{
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "收藏倒是不少。武器和杂物混在一起，你自己还认得清吗？",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "认得清，当然认得清！你看上哪件了？别光盯着那些剑，旁边也有好东西！",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "又来挑武器啦？这次可有你没见过的，拿起来看看！",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "等等……你手里的那把剑，怎么和我的藏品这么像？",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "只是投影。结构看过一次，就能试着重现。\n放心，原件还在你的架子上。我对搬空仓库没什么兴趣。",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "只是看一眼就……好吧，至少你没把它拿走。下一次先问一声！",
  
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "又把我叫回来了啊。既然还有力气召唤，至少把敌人的情报告诉我。",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "[sine]……向上……高塔……建筑师……必须……阻止……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……红衣的……弓兵……再一次……替我……登塔……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……弓兵……你的剑……为什么……还没……结束……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "弓兵不能用剑吗？你的要求还真多。\n上次没能解决，这次就换个办法。把能用的东西给我吧。",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "[sine]……拿走……继续……直到……建筑师……倒下……[/sine]",
  
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "……这种打量人的眼神，我可不太喜欢。有什么事就直说吧。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "哎呀，别板着脸嘛。难得来了个这么俊俏的英灵，让我多看两眼又有什么关系？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "又是这副不肯休息的样子。拿着吧，红衣的弓兵，这次可要好好照顾自己。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "失败一次，又不会让你的价值少掉一分。何必总把过错往自己身上揽？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "说得倒轻巧。习惯这种东西，可不是听两句劝就能改掉的。\n……不过，你的好意我收下了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "这不就好了？道谢的时候别皱眉，明明笑起来更好看。",
  
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "会说话，还会送礼物……这里的常识确实不太可靠。\n你找我有什么事？",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "红衣服！会变出剑！好朋友，送你宝贝！",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "好朋友，又来了！这次也有宝贝！要平安回来！",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "再变一次！那两把剑！喜欢，好喜欢！",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "只是两把用惯了的剑，没什么值得看的。\n……好吧，最后一次。别碰剑刃。",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "出来了！两把！好厉害！宝贝给你，朋友，要加油！",
  
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "龙的血肉……这种赠礼，还是先问清代价比较好。",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]不必交换什么……疲惫的英灵……取走你需要的……让自己歇一歇……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]又在追赶什么吗……弓兵……这里没有人催促你……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]我的血肉能填补伤口……却填不满你心里的空处……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "那种东西，早就不是换几块血肉能解决的了。\n……但能让我继续行动，就已经帮了大忙。",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]收下吧……也为自己留一点……不要每次都等到破碎……才肯停下……[/thinky_dots]",
  
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "满眼都是兵器。看来比起寒暄，你更愿意直接打一场。",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "[b]哈哈！识货！挑一件，拿去砍翻挡路的家伙！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "[b]又来了，弓兵！今天让我看看，你那两把剑还能玩出什么花样！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "[b]看一眼就能造出兵器？你不当铁匠，倒有些可惜！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "我做的是投影，不是锻造。真要论手艺，可不能混为一谈。\n不过，修理东西倒还算拿手。",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "[b]管它叫什么！能拿来打就好！带上这个，别让你的手艺生锈！[/b]",
  
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "这种时候还能喝上热茶……你这里倒像个能让人喘口气的地方。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "来得正好！快坐下[jitter][b]暖暖身子[/b][/jitter]，别把自己绷得那么紧！",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "茶已经泡好了！点心也有，今天要不要尝尝[jitter][b]热可可[/b][/jitter]？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "听说你也会做料理？下次留下来帮忙怎么样？大家一定会喜欢！",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "做几份点心倒不难。不过，茶泡好了就别一直温着，味道会变。\n……下次我带些配得上的东西来吧。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "那就说定了！这次先拿点东西上路。下次回来，可不许只喝一杯就走！",
  
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.char": "又是契约？把条件摆出来。尤其是你最不想让我看见的那几条。",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1.ancient": "咦嘻嘻，真谨慎啊，正义的伙伴。怎么，终于想起先读读价码了？",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "欢迎回来，守护者。放心，这一次的代价，我一定会写得清清楚楚……至少字是清楚的。",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.ancient": "我倒想知道，你当初签下那份契约时，有没有想到自己要替它收拾多少残局？",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0.next": "回击",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.char": "那份账还轮不到你来算。\n想拿我的过去抬价，就免了。谈条件，或者让路。",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2.ancient": "咦嘻嘻，真是难做的生意！拿去吧，红衣的英灵。看看这次，你又能保住多少！",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0r.ancient": "以剑为骨的英灵。你手中的兵器皆是仿造，却也想斩断我创造的秩序？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1r.char": "赝品也好，真品也罢，能挡住你的武器就足够了。\n至于这座塔的秩序……拿人命维持的东西，还是拆掉比较省事。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-1r.next": "拔出双剑",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-2r.ancient": "你曾为拯救多数而舍弃少数。如今，却来指责我的取舍？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.ancient": "又是你。守护者，你应该比谁都明白：牺牲不会终止，只会换一个名字。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-1r.char": "啊，我很清楚。清楚到已经听腻了这种说辞。\n既然我站在这里，就还轮不到你替他们决定结局。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-1r.next": "投影，开始",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-2r.ancient": "你否定自己的理想，却仍为它挥剑。那便让我看看，这份矛盾能支撑你多久。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0r.ancient": "无数兵器，无数次徒劳。你究竟还想从这座塔里救走谁？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1r.char": "至少，是眼前还能伸手拉住的人。\n拯救所有人这种大话，我已经不会说了。但这也不是袖手旁观的理由。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-1r.next": "举起武器",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-2r.ancient": "那就继续伸出手吧，英灵。看看先折断的，是你的剑，还是你不肯舍弃的愿望。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.STS2_EMIYA_MOD_CHARACTER_EMIYA_SHIROU.2-attack": "Both"
}
